15         Welcome to the team. You are now an 04IRC Operator15.

04======================================================================
04 OPERATOR RULES
04======================================================================

  041. You hold this power in trust. Use it only to keep the network
     safe and pleasant - never for personal gain or grudges.
  042. Be fair. Warn first when it is reasonable; every K/G/Z-line
     needs a real reason, and you must be able to explain it.
  043. Do not abuse users, channels or services you don't need to touch.
     No SAJOIN/SAMODE/KILL games, no snooping for fun.
  044. Privacy is sacred. Never share IPs, real hosts, logs or
     private messages outside of a genuine abuse investigation.
  045. Never give out oper credentials. Not to friends, not to staff.
     Lost or leaked a password? Tell the admins immediately.
  046. Stay accountable. Everything you do shows up in the server
     notices and logs. Leave a clear reason on every ban or kill.
  047. Settle disputes in the staff channel, not in public. Keep
     staff disagreements out of user channels.
  048. Off duty? /MODE yourself -o. Being idle as oper is fine,
     being absent while flagged as available is not.

09======================================================================
09 STAFF TOOLS
09======================================================================

  11/KLINE /GLINE /ZLINE  ban a host, a global mask, or an IP
  11/UNKLINE /UNGLINE /UNZLINE  lift them again
  11/KILL <nick> <reason>  disconnect a user
  11/SAJOIN /SAPART /SAMODE  force channel actions (use sparingly)
  11/CHGHOST /SETHOST  change a user's displayed host
  11/WALLOPS <text>  message every oper
  11/REHASH  reload config, MOTD, oper MOTD and rules
  11/OPERMOTD  show this text again

12======================================================================
12 SEKURNET IS HIRING
12======================================================================

  09Know IRC? Like keeping a network clean? 08Become an IRCop!
  15Regular, helpful users are the ones we look for. To apply:

     111. Hang out in 11#SekurNet and 11#help and be useful.
     112. Read the rules until you could recite them.
     113. Ask an existing oper or an admin about opening a slot.

  15Please don't ask for oper. If we need you, we'll ask you.

04======================================================================

  15Type 11/OPERMOTD15 to read this again.   09Stay sharp. Stay fair.
